  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ya te dije que no!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100590061002000740065002000640069006A006500200071007500650020006E006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Esa es la forma de\ntratar a un cliente?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF0045007300610020006500730020006C006100200066006F0072006D0061002000640065000A0074007200610074006100720020006100200075006E00200063006C00690065006E00740065003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Eh, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! Ya sé que no te\ncorresponde,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npero<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndame<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nuna<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmano,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nporfa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le iba a llevar una cosa a este tipo, pero,\ncuando le dije que no podía, se enojó<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny me retó a un combate Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le pedí que se llevara a mi querido Aggron,\npero ahora dice que no puede.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¿Cómo no me voy a enojar?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cómo quieres que transporte a un Aggron\nque pesa 360 kg?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF004300F3006D006F0020007100750069006500720065007300200071007500650020007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400650020006100200075006E00200041006700670072006F006E000A0071007500650020007000650073006100200033003600300020006B0067003F0021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Para ser tan floja, hablas mucho! ¡Te voy a\nenseñar cómo se trata a los clientes!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡Puedo con l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas dos si hace falta!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vine a Ciudad Luminalia específicamente\npara participar en los Juegos Z-A!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi no puedo derrotar a dos Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāeas\ndebiluch<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas como ustedes, no merezco participar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No hay forma de hacer que cambie de idea!\n¡Necesito tu ayuda para derrotarlo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Me ayudas con el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004D0065002000610079007500640061007300200063006F006E00200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Hasta cuándo me vas a hacer esperar?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0048006100730074006100200063007500E1006E0064006F0020006D006500200076006100730020006100200068006100630065007200200065007300700065007200610072003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tú y yo nos conocimos gracias a que Pancham\nme trajo tu bolsa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400FA0020007900200079006F0020006E006F007300200063006F006E006F00630069006D006F007300200067007200610063006900610073002000610020007100750065002000500061006E006300680061006D000A006D00650020007400720061006A006F00200074007500200062006F006C00730061002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lamento mucho que empezáramos con el pie\nizquierdo... ¡Muchas gracias por ayudarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Patético! ¡Mis Pokémon les darán una lección!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100500061007400E9007400690063006F0021002000A1004D0069007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006C00650073002000640061007200E1006E00200075006E00610020006C006500630063006900F3006E0021001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Nunca pensé que la competencia fuera tan dura\nen Ciudad Luminalia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E0075006E00630061002000700065006E007300E900200071007500650020006C006100200063006F006D0070006500740065006E006300690061002000660075006500720061002000740061006E00200064007500720061000A0065006E00200043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610021001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que mejor me olvido de los Juegos Z-A.\nVoy a turistear un poco y luego regresaré a casa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no se hubiera puesto así por lo de Aggron,\nle habría enseñado encantada la ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaam.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006800610061006D002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias por ayudarnos, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNos diste una mano a pesar del inconveniente\nde la bolsa... ¡Estamos muy agradecidos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando vi a Pancham con tu bolsa se me ocurrió\nempezar un negocio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0064006F00200076006900200061002000500061006E006300680061006D00200063006F006E00200074007500200062006F006C007300610020007300650020006D00650020006F0063007500720072006900F3000A0065006D00700065007A0061007200200075006E0020006E00650067006F00630069006F002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mostrarles la ciudad a los turistas y que\nPancham les lleve las maletas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pancham se puede meter en lugares donde no\ncabe una persona, así que me pareció una<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nidea increíble...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Todo bien? Ya se hizo un poco tarde...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ-",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006F0064006F0020006200690065006E003F002000590061002000730065002000680069007A006F00200075006E00200070006F0063006F002000740061007200640065002E002E002E001000020114002D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿André? Sí, sí, no pasa nada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0041006E0064007200E9003F0020005300ED002C0020007300ED002C0020006E006F002000700061007300610020006E006100640061002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tuve un pequeño problema, pero ya está\nsolucionado. ¡Voy para allá!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750076006500200075006E00200070006500710075006500F1006F002000700072006F0062006C0065006D0061002C0020007000650072006F002000790061002000650073007400E1000A0073006F006C007500630069006F006E00610064006F002E002000A10056006F00790020007000610072006100200061006C006C00E10021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me dijeron que te va muy bien en los Juegos Z-A.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY pensar que tu primer combate Pokémon en\nCiudad Luminalia fue contra mí... ¡Qué honor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno. ¡Espero verte pronto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002E002000A100450073007000650072006F002000760065007200740065002000700072006F006E0074006F0021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    }
